WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.310 align:start position:0%
 
you  war game red dragon is the latest title  in the spectacular RTS series you have  over 1300 combat units available in red  dragon the design and behavior of which  have been faithfully reproduced from  real vehicles reconnaissance is your  main weapon it allows you to assess the  composition and capabilities of the  opposing army to help you plan your  tactics all the unit types will be  useful in your battle strategy the  artillery can maintain offensive  pressure at long range while your  conventional forces and at rate enemy  defenses use air attacks to mount  lightning attacks on the enemy strategic  points but watch out for the  anti-aircraft defense because your  airborne units are fragile and expensive  remember to establish supply lines to  what good is a tank without shells or  fuel the infantry also plays a special  role in modern warfare and can be  rapidly deployed from transport vehicles  and places where it will be most  effective urban areas and forests  potential death traps for heavily  armored units in red dragon the conflict  shifts to Asia where you must exploit  the specific terrain and features of the  various battlefields use high positions  to surprise convoys and hollows in the  terrain to conduct Steel's maneuvers  conceal your forces in wooded areas to  lunch ambushes smoke screens are also an  excellent way of camouflaging your  troops waterways gain additional  importance with the introduction of  combat ships landing craft and  amphibious units that can move equally  well on land and sea  these mechanisms will be crucial in  every battle not only in the new dynamic  campaign but also a multiplayer mode  during incredibly intense conflicts  involving up to 20 players  simultaneously

